"上傳狀態" = "Upload Status";
"傳送中：%d　等待：%d　重試：%d" = "Uploading: %d   Waiting: %d   Retrying: %d";
"約 %d 秒後再次嘗試。" = "Retrying in about %d seconds.";
"待處理項目只有 Finder 顯示設定檔，不是你的文件內容。仍需通過鎖定檢查才能安全結束。" = "Only Finder view settings are pending, not document contents. The lock checks must still pass before quitting safely.";
"最近檢查" = "Last checked";
"關閉主視窗後仍會在背景上傳。要完全結束或換電腦，請先鎖定；未完成時 app 會保留快取並阻止正常結束。" = "Closing the main window keeps uploads running in the background. Lock before quitting or switching computers; pending changes are kept and prevent normal shutdown.";
"尚未鎖定：有上傳失敗或空間不足，本機修改已保留。請查看上傳狀態。" = "Not locked: uploads failed or storage is full. Local changes are kept. Check Upload Status.";
"保險箱資訊與雲端位置" = "Vault Information and Cloud Location";
"雲端存放位置" = "Cloud Location";
"複製雲端位置" = "Copy Cloud Location";
"雲端資料夾以識別碼命名；保險箱顯示名稱存在描述檔內。另一台電腦搜尋相同位置時會顯示此名稱。" = "Cloud folders use an identifier; the display name is stored in the descriptor. Searching the same location on another computer shows this name.";
"從這台 Mac 移除不會刪除雲端資料。若要永久刪除，請先在所有電腦鎖定並備份，再刪除上方位置的整個保險箱資料夾。" = "Removing this Mac's entry keeps cloud data. To delete permanently, lock on every computer and back up first, then delete the entire vault folder shown above.";
"刪除雲端保險箱…" = "Delete Cloud Vault…";
"刪除雲端保險箱" = "Delete Cloud Vault";
"請先鎖定保險箱。" = "Lock the vault first.";
"請先鎖定保險箱，並輸入完整名稱確認刪除。" = "Lock the vault and enter its full name to confirm deletion.";
"正在刪除雲端保險箱…" = "Deleting the cloud vault…";
"仍有電腦持有寫入標記，無法刪除。請先在各電腦鎖定保險箱。" = "A computer still holds a writer marker. Lock the vault on every computer before deleting.";
"雲端保險箱已刪除，但無法清除鑰匙圈中的解鎖資訊。" = "The cloud vault was deleted, but its saved unlock information could not be removed from Keychain.";
"從這台 Mac 移除不會刪除雲端資料。若要永久刪除，請先在各電腦鎖定並備份，再從更多選單選擇「刪除雲端保險箱」。" = "Removing this Mac's entry keeps cloud data. To delete permanently, lock on every computer and back up first, then choose Delete Cloud Vault from the More menu.";
"這會刪除雲端保險箱內的所有加密檔案，其他電腦也會失去存取。復原檔只能解鎖，不能還原被刪除的資料。" = "This deletes all encrypted files in the cloud vault and removes access from other computers. A recovery file can unlock a vault; it cannot restore deleted data.";
"我已確認各電腦已鎖定，且需要保留的檔案已另行備份。" = "I have locked the vault on every computer and separately backed up any files I want to keep.";
"輸入保險箱完整名稱以確認刪除。" = "Enter the full vault name to confirm deletion.";
"刪除可能無法復原；若網路中斷，可能只完成部分刪除。" = "Deletion may be irreversible. A network interruption may leave the vault partially deleted.";
"已啟用內建相容引擎，無需另外下載。" = "The bundled compatible engine is enabled. No separate download is needed.";
"修復上傳…" = "Repair Uploads…";
"修復上傳" = "Repair Uploads";
"正在保留修改並修復上傳…" = "Keeping local changes and repairing uploads…";
"無法修復：請先儲存並關閉使用保險箱的檔案，再試一次。本機修改會保留。" = "Could not repair. Save and close files using the vault, then try again. Local changes are kept.";
"請先儲存並關閉使用保險箱的檔案。CloudMount 會正常卸載、停止舊工作程序，再用內建相容引擎接回同一保險箱與快取，繼續上傳。" = "Save and close files using the vault first. CloudMount will unmount normally, stop the old worker, then reconnect the same vault and cache using the bundled compatible engine to continue uploading.";
"待上傳修改與寫入標記會保留；若無法正常卸載或確認舊程序停止，就不會建立重複掛載。" = "Pending changes and the writer marker are kept. No duplicate mount is started if normal unmounting or confirmation that the old worker stopped fails.";
"保留修改並修復上傳" = "Keep Changes and Repair Uploads";
"已停止舊程序，待重新解鎖以繼續上傳" = "Old worker stopped. Unlock again to continue uploading.";

