"正在請 Finder 開啟資料夾…" = "Asking Finder to open the folder…";
"已請 Finder 開啟資料夾；首次顯示內容可能需要等候雲端回應。" = "Finder has been asked to open the folder. The first listing may need a response from your cloud service.";
"此位置目前沒有掛載。請重新整理掛載狀態後再試。" = "Nothing is mounted at this location. Refresh the mount status and try again.";
"無法啟動 Finder 開啟工具。請重新開啟 CloudMount 或重新安裝 app。" = "The Finder helper could not start. Reopen CloudMount or reinstall the app.";
"尚未收到 Finder 的開啟確認。這不代表掛載失敗；請先查看 Finder，勿重複掛載。" = "Finder has not confirmed the request yet. This does not mean the mount failed. Check Finder before trying another mount.";

/* Remote vault storage folder selection */
"等待雲端回應逾時，請檢查網路後重試。" = "The cloud service did not respond in time. Check your connection and try again.";
"雲端拒絕登入，請檢查此遠端的帳號、密碼或存取權杖。" = "The cloud service rejected the login. Check this remote’s account, password, or access token.";
"無法在此位置建立資料夾。NAS 的最上層可能只列出共用資料夾，請按「選擇資料夾…」，進入 home 或其他可寫入的共用資料夾後再建立保險箱。" = "A folder cannot be created here. The NAS root may only list shared folders. Choose “Choose Folder…”, enter home or another writable share, then create your vault.";
"此位置不允許這項操作。請選擇可讀寫的資料夾，或檢查 NAS／雲端的存取權限。" = "This location does not allow this operation. Choose a writable folder or check the NAS or cloud permissions.";
"找不到指定的雲端位置。請重新選擇資料夾後再試。" = "The cloud location was not found. Choose the folder again and retry.";
"此位置不接受建立或寫入。NAS 請先進入可寫入的共用資料夾；不要直接在共用資料夾清單建立保險箱。" = "This location does not accept creating or writing files. On a NAS, enter a writable share before creating a vault.";
