/* Standard Cryptomator vaults */
"標準 Cryptomator" = "Standard Cryptomator";
"舊版測試格式" = "Legacy test format";
"新保險箱採用標準 Cryptomator 格式，可用官方 Cryptomator 開啟。換電腦時連接相同雲端、加入保險箱並輸入同一密碼即可。" = "New vaults use the standard Cryptomator format and can be opened with official Cryptomator. On another computer, connect the same storage, add the vault and enter the same password.";
"使用官方 Cryptomator 時，先將整個保險箱資料夾下載到本機，再加入其中的 vault.cryptomator。保留 masterkey.cryptomator 與 d 資料夾，使用相同密碼即可解鎖。" = "To use official Cryptomator, download the entire vault folder and add its vault.cryptomator file. Preserve masterkey.cryptomator and the d folder, then unlock with the same password.";
"同一保險箱請一次只在一台電腦編輯。官方 Cryptomator 不會遵循 CloudMount 的寫入標記，請先在其他程式鎖定再開啟。" = "Edit a vault on only one computer at a time. Official Cryptomator does not honor CloudMount writer markers; lock the vault in other apps before opening it here.";
"遠端內容已變更，已停止取代檔案。請重新整理並確認其他電腦已鎖定保險箱。" = "Remote content changed, so replacement was stopped. Refresh and make sure the vault is locked on other computers.";
"這是舊版測試保險箱，不能用官方 Cryptomator 開啟。請建立新保險箱，再複製解鎖後的檔案；確認上傳完成並鎖定後，再決定是否移除舊保險箱。" = "This is a legacy test vault and cannot be opened with official Cryptomator. Create a new vault and copy the unlocked files into it. Verify that uploads and locking finish before deciding whether to remove the old vault.";
"顯示復原詞" = "Show recovery key";
"復原詞" = "Recovery key";
"複製復原詞" = "Copy recovery key";
"這 44 個單詞可在官方 Cryptomator 復原密碼。持有人能解鎖保險箱，請離線安全保存，不要放在同一保險箱內。" = "These 44 words can reset the password in official Cryptomator. Anyone who has them can unlock the vault. Keep them safely offline, outside this vault.";
"復原詞只能解鎖，不能還原已刪除或遺失的檔案。" = "A recovery key unlocks the vault; it cannot restore deleted or missing files.";

