"目錄更新間隔" = "Directory refresh interval";

"%d 分鐘" = "%d minutes";

"目錄清單在掛載期間暫存於記憶體。間隔越長，重複查詢越少，但其他電腦的變更可能較晚出現；預設 5 分鐘。" = "Directory listings are kept in memory while mounted. Longer intervals reduce repeat requests but can delay changes from other computers. The default is 5 minutes.";

"Finder 縮圖由 macOS 產生與管理。首次預覽仍可能下載原圖；開啟檔案快取可重用已讀內容，不會預先掃描或下載所有圖片。" = "macOS generates and manages Finder thumbnails. The first preview may still download the original image. File caching reuses data already read, without scanning or downloading all images in advance.";

"系統會盡量保留 1 GB 可用空間，並降低每個讀取的記憶體緩衝；未上傳或正在使用的快取不會為了清理而刪除。" = "The cache aims to leave 1 GB free and uses smaller read buffers. Pending uploads and files in use are not removed to reclaim space.";
